{"id":"n16448-1-7","stage":2,"title":"상금 · 赏金","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16448-1-7-1","ko":"일 등을 하면 얼마의 상금이 주어지나요?","zh":"第一名能得多少奖金？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일","meaning":"第一","explanation":"일：第一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31528","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"등을","meaning":"第……名","explanation":"등：第……名；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49990","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마의","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상금이","meaning":"赏金","explanation":"상금：赏金；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상금","audio":"/audio/f54d2e420a77031ef8f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16448","senseId":"1","lemma":"상금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주어지나요?","meaning":"具有，赋予，现有","explanation":"주어지다：具有，赋予，现有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"주어지다","audio":"/audio/2ac36a5ee66c0a0713ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25958","senseId":"1","lemma":"주어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"第一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31528","definition":"第一次的。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"第……名","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"49990","definition":"表示等级或名次的单位。","